STOMIZE YOUR MINER WITH UNIQUE DNA BUILDS. PLACE THE ACCESSORIES WHEREVER YOU WANT!\n\n**FIGHT BOSSES.** \n{1992847338010690}\nCLAIM TREASURE. TAKE DOWN POWERFUL BOSSES DEEP UNDERGROUND AND CLAIM RARE REWARDS.\n\n**TECH TREE.**\n{1342354037946372}\nUPGRADE YOUR GEAR AND ABILITIES TO BECOME STRONGER WITH EVERY RUN.\n\n**PLAY TOGETHER.**\n{1761786788533442}\nTEAM UP WITH UP TO 11 PLAYERS AND SURVIVE THE MINES.\n\n**WELCOME TO THE MINES.**\n{1363649142273658}\nENTER A PORTAL, GO DEEPER, AND SURVIVE THE RUN.\n\n**UPDATES EVERY WEDNESDAY.**\n\nJOIN THE DISCORD \ud83d\udc49 https://discord.com/invite/pickaboom\n\n**WELCOME, MINER. CONGRATULATIONS ON JOINING PICKABOOM!** IF YOU\u2019RE A HARD WORKER, A GOOD SHOT AND A RELIABLE TEAM PLAYER, YOU SHOULD HAVE RESPECTABLE ODDS OF SURVIVAL.\n\n\n", "short_description": "\ud83d\udc7b SPOOKY ADVENTURES\n\u26a0\ufe0f DANGEROUS BOSS FIGHTS\n\u26cf\ufe0f MINE AND LOOT \n\ud83d\udd2b NEW PVP ARENA\n\ud83d\udca8 RACE MODE\n\nSMASH DOWNLOAD NOW. PICKABOOM IT'S FREE VR GAME!\n\nJOIN THE DISCORD \ud83d\udc49 [https://discord.com/invite/pickaboom](https://discord.com/invite/pickaboom)"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.pigiamakasama.com/pickaboom-vr/dedicated-policy-privacy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": "https://www.pigiamakasama.com/pickaboom-vr/dedicated-policy-privacy", "publisher_name": "PIGIAMA KASAMA", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://www.pigiamakasama.com/pickaboom-vr", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_SOME", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "3744040075834813"}, {"id": "528142316460358"}, {"id": "459781504968480"}, {"id": "1023770785722696"}, {"id": "644354873106712"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memo